<title>UK: Bankers Trust warrants on Mexican Peso/U.S. Dollar.</title>
<headline>Bankers Trust warrants on Mexican Peso/U.S. Dollar.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bankers Trust International Plc says it has issued a total of one million European-style call warrants, on the Mexican Nuevo Peso against the U.S. Dollar.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    $7.95		     PREMIUM	=</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     $2.40		     GEARING	=</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   27.DEC.96		 PAYDATE	09.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUX			 MIN EXER LOT 5000</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
